sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Feature UI (Ch 6)
    participant Ctrl as PermissionController
    participant Sys as System dialog / Settings

    User->>UI: tap "Scan" (camera)
    UI->>Ctrl: state(CAMERA)
    alt granted
        Ctrl-->>UI: Granted
        UI->>UI: open scanner
    else denied, can ask
        Ctrl-->>UI: DeniedCanAsk
        UI->>User: rationale ("Scan needs the camera to read codes")
        User->>UI: continue
        UI->>Sys: launch request
        Sys-->>UI: result (granted/denied)
    else permanently denied
        Ctrl-->>UI: PermanentlyDenied
        UI->>User: "Enable Camera in Settings"
        User->>Sys: open app settings (Ch 52)
    end
